# Project Structure

Civic Lab is a collaborative Canon + Country Manuals prototype (thread-first wiki/forum
hybrid). Product vocabulary lives in `CONCEPT.md`.

## Top-level layout

| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `CONCEPT.md` | Reference vision (Canon, Manuals, threads/RFCs, claims, Red Team) |
| `PLANNING.md` | Milestones, sequencing, coordination status board |
| `OPEN_ISSUES.md` | Current open prototype work + acceptance criteria |
| `SCRATCHPAD.json` | Agent live session snapshot |
| `src/app/` | Routes, pages, UI components, client models |
| `src/editor/` | Plate/Slate editor, embeds, commands, navigation |
| `src/doc/` | Document model, validation, evidence helpers |
| `src/api/` | Client API, schemas, actions |
| `server/` | Express API |
| `db/` | JSON persistence (pages, revisions, terms, etc.) |
| `content/` | Docs/MDX content (Fumadocs) |
| `dist/` | Build output (usually not hand-edited) |

## Conventions

- Prefer extending existing editor/doc patterns over new parallel systems.
- Keep Canon vs Manuals **lane hygiene** in mind when adding UI copy or data model fields
  (descriptive / prescriptive / alignment).
- Roadmap → `PLANNING.md`; concrete open work → `OPEN_ISSUES.md`; session memory →
  `SCRATCHPAD.json`. Do not use `CONCEPT.md` as a task tracker.
